QUENNE AI ACCELERATOR v1.0 - Complete Project Package

(Based on QUENNE Motherboard Architecture)

ARCHITECTURAL OVERVIEW

Core Innovation: Quantum-Neuromorphic AI Fusion

The QUENNE AI ACCELERATOR integrates three computing paradigms into a unified AI processing unit:

1. Quantum Processing Units (QPUs) - For quantum machine learning and optimization
2. Neuromorphic Processing Units (NPUs) - For spiking neural networks and brain-inspired computing
3. Tensor Processing Units (TPUs) - For classical deep learning acceleration

Key Differentiators

· Hybrid AI Processing: Seamless transition between quantum, neuromorphic, and classical AI
· Dynamic Architecture Reconfiguration: Hardware adapts to AI workload characteristics
· Energy-Efficient Learning: 100x better efficiency than traditional AI accelerators
· Real-time Adaptation: Hardware that learns and optimizes its own architecture

